    ("Nelson Leirner: Bandeja (Tray)", "Nelson Leirner", 1966, "Stuffed pig on tray", "Brazilian Neo-Dada / Conceptual", ["conceptual","institutional critique","pig","brazil","provocation"], ["stuffed pig","tray","institutional critique","provocation"], ["pink pig","silver tray"], "Pinacoteca do Estado, São Paulo", "A stuffed pig arranged on a silver serving tray — submitted to the official Salon and accepted.", "When the Salon jury accepted this work without noticing it was a provocation, Leirner leaked it to the press. The scandal launched Brazilian conceptualism.", "male", "Brazilian"),
