    ("Lee Ufan: From Line", "Lee Ufan", 1977, "Oil on canvas", "Mono-ha / Korean-Japanese", ["minimal","line","presence","material","contemplative"], ["single brushstroke","fading line","canvas edge","presence","silence"], ["grey blue","white canvas","single mark"], "Guggenheim Bilbao", "A single brushstroke of grey-blue that begins at the canvas edge and fades to nothing before reaching the other.", "Lee Ufan's single marks carry the full weight of his philosophy: the mark is the event of meeting between hand, paint, and canvas.", "male", "Korean"),
